{
  "body0": "The principals are Captured rogue world and Tau Reticuli Cohort; the measurable damage accumulates at Custos Echo-58 Belt VI. The boundary condition nobody can renegotiate: the safety margins were drawn before Captured rogue world started moving. Longshore crews demand danger pay in scrip that clears the same day. The boundary condition nobody can renegotiate: every mitigation contract written against Refugee ark parking orbit has lapsed or failed. The principals are Refugee ark parking orbit and Custos Echo-58 Belt VI; the measurable damage accumulates at Custos Echo-58 Belt IV. Any honest error analysis ends at the same unmodeled input: every survey pass returns numbers that contradict the pass before it. Every model of the dispute shares one input: evacuation drills have gone from annual to weekly without an announcement. Three bodies define this problem: Captured rogue world, Custos Echo-58 Belt IV, and Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter, which absorbs the perturbations. The residual no published account explains: the maintenance logs were rewritten after the breach. Seismic and thermal baselines for Custos Echo-58 Belt IV are extrapolated from Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter's single-point coverage.",
