{
  "body0": "Salt Wound Wake moved its families off-station last month and denies it moved anything. Pale Saint Wake sharpens, Salt Wound Wake braces, and Bone Lantern Order learns to sleep in a pressure suit. The war is on, whatever the bulletins call it. Every shift change, someone repaints the boundary line around Calvera-10 IV minor-body complex Hold a hand-width farther out. The fight belongs to Bone Lantern Order and Salt Wound Wake; the bleeding is done at Pale Saint Wake. Nobody pretends anymore; the boundary lines get repainted in daylight. The war is on, whatever the bulletins call it. Carrion Synod circles Crown of Dust Pact the way debt circles a harvest. The public channel carries two incompatible traffic advisories for the same lane.",
